  "priorExpiration": "2002-12-19",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fam 202.01 Principles of Dispute Resolution. The board shall resolve by agreement or by a decision all disputes about non-criminal matters within the scope of RSA 328-C and the administrative rules implementing that statute.\n\nSource. #5609, eff 4-6-93, EXPIRED: 4-6-99\n\nNew. #7716, INTERIM, eff 6-22-02, EXPIRED: 12-19-02\n\nNew. #8369, eff 6-7-05; ss by #9668, eff 4-2-10; ss by 12633, eff 10-2-18",
